<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>OpenWrt Packages Feed</title>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
    body {
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin: 3rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
      font: 16px/1.65 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }
    code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }
    pre { padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; border-radius: .5rem; background: #8881; }
    h1 { margin-bottom: .25rem; }
    .muted { opacity: .7; }
    table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; }
    th, td { text-align: left; padding: .4rem .6rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #8884; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>OpenWrt Packages Feed</h1>
  <p class="muted">OpenWrt @SUPPORTED_RELEASES_TEXT@ · apk v3 · signed feed（built with @BUILD_VERSION@）</p>

  <h2>安装</h2>
  <pre><code>uclient-fetch -O /tmp/install-feed.sh \
  @BASE_URL@/install-feed.sh
sh /tmp/install-feed.sh
apk add &lt;package&gt;</code></pre>

  <h2>架构</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>DISTRIB_ARCH</th><th>Feed URL</th></tr>
@ARCH_ROWS@
  </table>
  <p class="muted">Feed 路径中的 @BUILD_VERSION@ 是构建版本；安装脚本接受所有 OpenWrt @SUPPORTED_RELEASES_TEXT@ 设备。</p>

  <h2>签名公钥</h2>
  <p><a href="public-key.pem">public-key.pem</a> · <a href="keys/keyring.sha256">keyring.sha256</a></p>
</body>
</html>
